VERSION-NEXT: License: Mulan PSL v2.
VERSION-NEXT: {{^$}}
VERSION-NEXT: Build Info:
VERSION-NEXT: Date: {{.+}}
VERSION-NEXT: Repo: https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msdebug
